格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"\"Weniger\" — less, but better: a Dieter Rams-inspired theme for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI","id":"gh:1338782348","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-weniger-theme","slug":"lesliechowsh/dsh-weniger-theme","topics":["deepseek-harness","dieter-rams","dsh-plugin","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"\"Weniger\" — less, but better: a Dieter Rams-inspired theme for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Weniger"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文文档"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*„Weniger, aber besser\" — Less, but better.*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A Dieter Rams-inspired theme for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web GUI: warm paper whites, hairline bor"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ders, near-black ink, one signal-orange accent, squared 0–4px geometry, flat surfaces, and a single "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"Swiss type stack across the whole UI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Install as a DSH web plugin, then restart `dsh web`:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> **Upgrading from ≤ 0.1.3?** Those versions shipped no `dsh.bundle` declaration,\n> so `dsh plugin a"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"dd` silently installed the package as a plain dependency —\n> the theme never loaded and `/plugins/ds"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"h-weniger-theme/client.js` returned\n> 404. 0.1.4 adds `cordis.patch.yml` as a bundle patch layer; re"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"-run the add\n> command above (or `dsh plugin --profile web update dsh-weniger-theme`) and\n> restart "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"`dsh web` — the reconciler picks up the declaration automatically."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Or straight from the GitHub repo:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Deployments without the dsh plugin subcommand (manual install)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Install the package into your web profile:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"2. Append one insert entry to the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"3. Restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"(Manual installs: remove the `cordis.patch.yml` entry and the dependency, then restart.) The theme s"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"witches the UI to the light scheme once on activation; you can switch back to dark in Settings → App"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"earance afterwards — the Weniger dark palette is complete."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Remaps the entire design-token graph (theme-service tokens, derived tokens, and the static color r"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"amp) to a warm Braun-style palette, in both light and dark modes.\n- Converges every component radius"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" to a 0–4px grid and flattens all shadows.\n- Recolors the user bubble, code blocks, send button, act"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ive-nav accents, focus rings, selection, and the syntax-highlight palette.\n- Adds a footer chip (ora"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"nge square + label) that opens a small panel quoting the ten principles of good design, with attribu"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"quare + label) that opens a small panel quoting the ten principles of good design, with attribution."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- `client.js` + `index.js` + `package.json` — the plugin as a standard DSH client module (`dsh.clien"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"t` manifest).\n- `weniger-theme.client.js` — the development form (dynamic plugin) used for iteration"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"; not required for installation.\n- `ui-probe.host.js` / `ui-probe.client.js` — self-review tooling u"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"sed during development.\n- `DESIGN-NOTES.md` — design decisions: token layers, palette, radius grid, "},{"id":"p24s5","text":"verification loop.\n- `docs/` — screenshots."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT — see `LICENSE`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Attribution & disclaimer"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Inspired by the design philosophy of Dieter Rams and his ten principles of good design, quoted brief"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ly in the UI as homage. This project is **not** affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Dieter"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" Rams, Vitsœ, Braun GmbH, or Procter & Gamble. \"Braun\" is a trademark of its respective owner; no Br"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"aun trademarks, logos, or product designs are reproduced here. The color palette and layout values a"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ks, logos, or product designs are reproduced here. The color palette and layout values are original."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
